---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /resume/
title: Resume
description: Download Andrew Estrada’s mechanical engineering resume covering Formula SAE, manufacturing internships, CNC machining, and technical skills.
---
<header class="page-hero">
  <div class="container page-hero__inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Resume</p>
    <h1>Resume</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      One-page overview of education, experience, and technical skills for mechanical engineering roles.
    </p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container contact-panel">
    <div class="resume-panel">
      <h2>Download PDF</h2>
      <p>
        Use the PDF for applications and quick screening. Project pages on this site provide deeper engineering context.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="button" href="{{ site.resume.pdf }}">Download resume PDF</a>
        <a class="button button--secondary" href="/experience/">View experience</a>
      </div>
      <img
        class="resume-preview"
        src="{{ site.resume.preview }}"
        alt="Preview of Andrew Estrada’s resume"
        width="737"
        height="885"
        loading="lazy"
      >
    </div>
    <div class="contact-card">
      <h2>Quick facts</h2>
      <ul class="contact-list">
        <li><strong>Degree:</strong> {{ site.education.degree }}</li>
        <li><strong>School:</strong> {{ site.education.school }}</li>
        <li><strong>Focus:</strong> Mechanical design, manufacturing, tooling, test</li>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></li>
        <li><strong>LinkedIn:</strong> <a href="{{ site.linkedin }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Profile</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
